{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697860/extras/Coop.gif?t=1752918600\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697860/extras/EN_\u0434\u043b\u044f_\u043d\u0435\u0441\u043a\u043e\u043b\u044c\u043a\u0438\u0445_\u0438\u0433\u0440\u043e\u043a\u043e\u0432.png?t=1752918600\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Team up with friends for cooperative gameplay! Work together to overcome obstacles, solve puzzles, and reach new heights - because everything's more fun together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697860/extras/3rd_person.gif?t=1752918600\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697860/extras/EN_\u041f\u0440\u0438\u043a\u043b\u044e\u0447\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435_\u043e\u0442_\u0442\u0440\u0435\u0442\u044c\u0435\u0433\u043e_\u043b\u0438\u0446\u0430.png?t=1752918600\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic over-the-shoulder gameplay immerses you in world exploration. The optimal camera angle helps precisely time jumps, discover hidden paths, and enjoy breathtaking vistas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697860/extras/head_crack.gif?t=1752918600\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697860/extras/EN_\u0433\u043e\u043b\u043e\u0432\u043e\u043b\u043e\u043c\u043a\u0438.png?t=1752918600\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Encounter clever puzzles and mechanisms requiring teamwork and wit. Solve them to unlock new areas and gain unexpected abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697860/extras/parcour.gif?t=1752918600\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697860/extras/EN_\u041f\u043b\u0430\u0442\u0444\u043e\u0440\u043c\u0438\u043d\u0433_\u0438_\u043f\u0430\u0440\u043a\u0443\u0440.png?t=1752918600\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Test your skills through challenging yet rewarding jumps, climbs, and balancing acts. Every move matters - one wrong step means starting over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697860/extras/pretty_graphics.gif?t=1752918600\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697860/extras/EN_\u041d\u0435\u0437\u0430\u043c\u044b\u0441\u043b\u043e\u0432\u0430\u0442\u0430\u044f_\u043f\u0440\u0438\u044f\u0442\u043d\u0430\u044f_\u0433\u0440\u0430\u0444\u0438\u043a\u0430.png?t=1752918600\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A bright, friendly art style creates a lighthearted atmosphere without visual clutter. Clean shapes and vibrant colors make the game world expressive and easy on the eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=